-- Food and Nutrition Act of 2008 (7 U.S.C. ch. 51), sections 2036b (retail food store and recipient trafficking), 2036c (annual State report on verification of SNAP participation) and 2036d (pilot projects to encourage public-private partnerships).
-- LAYER 1 (the law, objectively). Same reading of results as snap4-s2020-a-d.l4: JUST TRUE / JUST FALSE / NOTHING.
-- The text is the converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text.
-- Dates of the Act are `Date day month year`. A fiscal year is its number, and 2027 is 1 October 2026 to 30 September 2027 (snap-core.l4).

