§ `s 2036d(b) Definitions`

DECLARE `s 2036d(b)(1) kind of entity` IS ONE OF
    `s 2036d(b)(1)(A) a nonprofit organization`
    `s 2036d(b)(1)(B) a community-based organization`
    `s 2036d(b)(1)(C) an institution of higher education`
    `s 2036d(b)(1)(D) a private entity`
    `s 2036d(b)(1) some other kind of entity`

-- src:3300 | For purposes of this section—
-- src:3301 | (1) the term “eligible entity” means—
-- src:3302 | (A) a nonprofit organization;
-- src:3303 | (B) a community-based organization;
-- src:3304 | (C) an institution of higher education; or
-- src:3305 | (D) a private entity, as determined by the Secretary; and
-- jural: none | none | none: a definition; it creates no right, duty, power or immunity
@ref s 2036d(b)(1) (src:3300-3305)
GIVEN `the entity` IS A `s 2036d(b)(1) kind of entity`
      `s 2036d(b)(1)(D) the Secretary has determined that the private entity is an eligible entity` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036d(b)(1) the entity is an eligible entity` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the entity`
    WHEN `s 2036d(b)(1)(A) a nonprofit organization` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 2036d(b)(1)(B) a community-based organization` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 2036d(b)(1)(C) an institution of higher education` THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "a private entity, as determined by the Secretary"; the determination is the Secretary's and is supplied by the caller
    WHEN `s 2036d(b)(1)(D) a private entity` THEN `s 2036d(b)(1)(D) the Secretary has determined that the private entity is an eligible entity`
    WHEN `s 2036d(b)(1) some other kind of entity` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the term “eligible entity” means"

DECLARE `s 2036d(b)(2) level of government` IS ONE OF
    `s 2036d(b)(2) Federal government`
    `s 2036d(b)(2) State government`
    `s 2036d(b)(2) local government`
    `s 2036d(b)(2) some other government`

-- src:3306 | (2) the term “public agency” means a department, agency, other unit, or instrumentality of Federal, State, or local government.
-- jural: none | none | none: a definition; it creates no right, duty, power or immunity
@ref s 2036d(b)(2) (src:3306)
GIVEN `the body is a department, agency, other unit, or instrumentality` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the level of government` IS A `s 2036d(b)(2) level of government`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2036d(b)(2) the body is a public agency` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the body is a department, agency, other unit, or instrumentality`
            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the term “public agency” means a department, agency, other unit, or instrumentality"
        IF `the level of government` EQUALS `s 2036d(b)(2) some other government`
            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "of Federal, State, or local government"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

